window.products.push({"id":106124,"name":"OEM 134637810 Washer Water Inlet Valve by Beaquicy (5 YEAR WARRANTY) - Replacement for Ken-more Crosley Washing Machine -Replaces 134637800, 713463780","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61yiOwpDw7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✅ 【PRODUCT SPECIFICATIONS】: Water inlet valve 134637810 supplies water to the washing machine and allows you to control the amount of cold and hot water that goes into the machine. This part can become old or worn out, resulting in problems with water flow. This is a 4 coil valve. There is not a thermistor on this valve. The dimensions are about 4.4 inches wide by 9.5 inches long by 3.5 inches high. The rated voltage is 120V 65Hz. The package includes 1 x 134637810 Washer Water Inlet Valve. ✅【FUNCTIONS&HIGHLIGHTS】: 134637810 water inlet valve electrolux is made of durable high quality ABS plastic, designed to be more durable and stable, improve durability and high compatibility. It is designed to allow you to control the amount of cold and hot water entering the washing machine. The part can fix the following symptoms: ①Your washer was leaking; ②Make noise; ③Will not drain; ④The clothes are wetter than usual; ⑤Pump but will not spin. ✅ 【WIDE COMPATIBILE】 -134637810 Washer Water Inlet Valve can replacement for Crosl-ey, Electrolux, Frigid-aire, Ken-more washing machine. ◆ Replace number: 41741100000, 41741101000, 41741102000, 41744130000, 41744131000, 41744132000, FAFS4272LW0, FAFS4473LW0, FAFS4272LA0, LAFW8000LW0, EIFLW50LIW0, FAFS4474LA0, EIFLS55IIW0, EWFLS65IIW0, EIFLS55IIW1, EIFLS55IMB1, CFW7700LR0, EIFLS55IRR0, EIFLS60JIW0, EIFLS60JMB0, EIFLS60JRR0, EIFLS60LSS0, EIFLS60LT0, EIFLS60LT1, EIFLW50LIW1, EIFLW55IKG0, etc. ✅ 【AFTER-SALES GUARANTEE】 - The 134637810 Washer Water Inlet Valve support 5 YEARS return and exchange. Our company attaches great importance to the shopping experience of each customer.Risk-free shopping, If you have any quality problem during warranty period, please contact customer service in time. We will try our best to solve the problem. Customer satisfaction is our tireless pursuit. ✅ 【CONVENIENT YOUR LIFE】: To install 134637810 Washer Water Inlet Valve Assembly , switch off the washing machine, then turn off the water and remove the hose. Next remove two screws from top at back of washer remove top. Unscrew counter weight move to front. Unhook electrical plugs unscrew valve wiggle free. Make sure to save black rubber seals for new valve. Finally reverse process to close and test. It takes about 15 minutes to complete the installation, eliminating a lot of hassle for you.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61yiOwpDw7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Beaquicy","source_asin":"B083F9NVD7","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-106124","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B083F9NVD7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B083F9NVD7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
