window.products.push({"id":106199,"name":"Portable Washer 2.3 Cu.ft, 17.8Lbs Capacity Full-Automatic Washing Machine with Drain Pump, 10 Wash Programs, 8 Water Levels and Display Panel for Dor","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":249.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61XIlr82fML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Mode Selection】This washing machine has 10 programs to choose from: 1. Standard 2. Soft 3. Quick wash 4. Heavy duty 5. Soak wash 6. Wash only 7. Spin only 8. Tub clean 9. Tub air dry 10. Water recycle. With 8 water levels: Minimum/Low/Medium/High. You can easily choose the appropriate program and water level to meet your needs. 【Multifunctional Control Panel】All functions of this portable washing machine are clearly explained on the control panel, including program/delay, water level/spin, time setting and child lock. Just put in your dirty laundry, add water, choose a washing program and start washing in no time! 【Fully Automatic Washing Machine】The washing and dehydration functions of this washer can be used separately. Just set the washing/spinning program and the washer can work alone. This washer also features a new lint filter to easily filter out impurities. Comes with a drain pump and extension hose for easy drainage - perfect for apartments without floor drains. 【Delay Function】This portable washing machine has a 24-hour delay washing function. You can set the desired wash start time in advance according to your needs. ⚡Importantly: Equipped with multiple faucet adapters to meet the needs of the faucet interface. 【Child Lock】When the lid is opened, the washing machine will automatically shut off to prevent children from touching the machine. Once turned off, the washer will resume operation. Once the child lock function is set, all buttons will be locked. 【Automatic Unbalance Adjustment】The washing machine is equipped with Automatic Unbalance Detection (AUD). When the clothes in the bucket are placed unevenly, it will cause severe vibration. The imbalance adjustment function of our portable washing machine will automatically activate to adjust the imbalance. 【Compact Design】This portable washing machine is lightweight and compact (18.9\"D x 18.9\"W x 31.5\"H), which can be easily moved and save space.Great for homes, dorms, apartments, RVs and camping. 【Detailed design】The portable washer is designed with a rust-resistant steel inner tub and a transparent lid, allowing you to monitor the washing conditions. In addition, this portable laundry washing machine has an LED display that shows the time left to finish. 【Service Hotline】Provide two-year warranty service. If you have any questions about this product, you can contact us through the after-sales email, and we will provide you with the most friendly help. Thank you for your trust and choice of our products!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61XIlr82fML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Nictemaw","source_asin":"B0BZTWDLNF","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-106199","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BZTWDLNF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BZTWDLNF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
