window.products.push({"id":106524,"name":"2-Pack: SuperTerrific 16\" inch Impulse Sealer Heating Element Service Spare Repair Parts Kit PFS-400 FS-400 PSF-400 PSF400 F-400","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61A+nz1c2rL._SL1300_.jpg","description":"Hi folks thanks for checking these replacement heating wires. These types of sealing machines are made by tons of different manufacturers that all use very similar parts and usually the same model numbers so while these will fit most 16\" sealers from most brands, it's possible it won't fit yours despite having its model number listed here. In that case, no hard feelings, returns are free :). To be certain if it will fit your machine you must remove and measure the length of your existing heating wire. Be sure to unplug your machine from a power source before working on it. With your heating wire removed and machine, check the points of the machine where it was attached. Most sealers have the heating wire screwed onto a hinge or spring so that they can use a wire even if it's about 1.5-2cm longer or shorter than your original part. If you can push or pull on the wire attachment points and they move, then your machine can also accept wires that aren't exactly the same length as your original ones. Sorry for lack of paragraphs. It won't let me add line breaks here for some reason.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61A+nz1c2rL._SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NEOVIC","source_asin":"B07T4XWP75","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-106524","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07T4XWP75","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B07T4XWP75","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
