window.products.push({"id":106631,"name":"HCK 24 Inch Under Counter Refrigerator - Stainless Steel Double Drawer Beverage Fridge for Home Bar, Outdoor and Commercial Indoor Use","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":1274.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71fX1hLwQiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Flexible and Efficient Storage Solution】: With two storage tiers, HCK beverage refrigerator provides flexible storage options to hold up to 21 standard 750ml bottles of red wine on the upper level and 70 330ml cans of beverages on the lower level. The convenient control panel and flexible adjustment functions allow you to customize storage conditions to suit different seasons and temperatures, ensuring that your wine and beverages are always kept at their best. 【Precise Temperature Control】: HCK beverage refrigerator features an electronic thermostat that precisely controls the temperature for optimal storage conditions，providing the best storage conditions and taste for your wine and beverage. The upper level temperature adjustment range of 53 to 71℉ is perfect for storing various flavors and types of red wines, while the lower tier with a temperature adjustment range of 32 to 50℉ maintains the optimal taste of your beverages. 【Durable and Weather-Resistant Design】: Made with a stainless steel cabinet, HCK beverage refrigerator provides excellent durability and corrosion resistance. The stainless steel material is also easy to clean, keeping your refrigerator hygienic and tidy. With an IPX4 water-resistant rating, it's suitable for outdoor use and resistant to natural factors such as wind and rain, making it a reliable choice for any environment. 【Space-Saving and Energy-Efficient Design】: Our HCK beverage refrigerator's front-vented design makes it easy to install in tight spaces and is more energy-efficient than conventional refrigerators. The front airflow reduces heat dissipation, which not only saves electricity costs but also makes it ideal for small bar spaces. Plus, its compact size provides maximum space savings while keeping your beverages cool and fresh. 【Automatic Defrost Function】:HCK under counter refrigerator is equipped with an automatic defrost function, eliminating the tedious and unnecessary trouble of manual defrosting. This function not only saves time and effort but also improves the refrigerator's energy efficiency, reducing electricity consumption and costs. With this feature, your wine and beverages are always stored under optimal conditions, ensuring convenience and efficiency","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71fX1hLwQiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HCK","source_asin":"B0BFQTG8PP","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-106631","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BFQTG8PP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BFQTG8PP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
