window.products.push({"id":106658,"name":"Clothes Dryer 110V Electric Foldable 2-Tier Drying Machine with Remote Control Heater Double Layer Stainless Steel Rack for Home,Apartment,Hotel,Stude","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":87.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/618HWtW8HDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【REMOTE CONTROL & TIMER】Our heater is equipped with a wireless remote control.The longest drying time is 240 minutes.You can set the drying time requirements for different clothes and seasons.When the set time is up,the machine will shut down automatically. If your clothes are thick, you can choose to turn on the machine to increase the drying time.Our dryer machine comes with a installation instruction. 【FOLDABLE 2-TIER RACK】The two-tier designed make it not only high but also has a large space.And the high-quality stainless steel allows thick single tube can bear 15kg of clothing to be in the foldable dryer.When the dryer is not in use,it can be folded without dismantling,convenient for storage and space saving.Or you can use it as a wardrobe to place clothes. 【TEMPERATURE CONTROL】Using our dryer can make your clothes wrinkle freely,so you don't have to spend too much time ironing them.Our dryer uses the wind to dry your clothes.There are three gear winds: high speed wind, low speed wind and breeze.The high-speed and low-speed temperatures are 37-75 degrees, and the breeze temperature is the local actual temperature,so you can choose the wind according to different clothes. 【HEALTHY】Having a clothes dryer is like having a drying shop for your own.You don't need to worry about the clothes in the drying shop outside,they are all mixed and dried together,which is unsanitary.You don't need to spend too much time waiting in line clothes drying shop,you also can save a lot of money for drying clothes. 【APPLIBILITY OF DRYER】Are there any of these problems that have been bothering you?In rainy days,clothes is dried,but they smell bad;in wet days and cold days,the clothes are hard to dry.If you have our clothes drying machine,it can help you solve these problems.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/618HWtW8HDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KOFOHON","source_asin":"B08D8Y35QZ","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-106658","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08D8Y35QZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B08D8Y35QZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
