window.products.push({"id":106677,"name":"Commercial Ice Maker, 100LBS/24H Under Counter Ice Machine w/ 0.6 Cu.Ft. Ice Bin, 45 Ice Cubes/Cycle, 2 Water Inlet Modes, Self Clean, FDA&ETL, 24H Ti","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71wgkENtgAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Amazing Ice Making Speed】- Powerful and professional, LifePlus under counter commercial ice maker is specially designed for commercial and big families that need a lot of ice. It can produce 100LBS of ice in 24H and 45 pieces of clear ice cubes per 10~29 mins. Definitely a good partner in your life and business. 【0.6 Cu.Ft. Ice Bin with Thermal Insulation Foam Layer (No Freezing Function)】- We designed a large ice bin (0.6 Cu.Ft) for the commercial ice machine, which can hold 15~25LBS of ice. With a thermal insulation foam layer and ice overflow protection, it will save your water and electricity a lot by lower the melting speed of ice and prevent excessive ice making. 【2 Water Inlet Modes & Adjustable Ice Thickness】- The thickness of ice can be adjusted by adjusting the time of single round ice making. The longer the ice making time, the thicker the ice will be. And 2 water inlet modes allow you to connect tap water directly or use bucket water. With freestanding design, it makes you can move the ice maker anywhere to make ice. Super suitable for heavy use for your party and business. 【Easy To Operate & Install】- Super user friendly! The simple control panel enable you to use the commercial ice machine easily and successfully. The indicator lights and LED display will clearly let you know how it works. As for installation, it only takes 3~5 steps to complete. You don't have to spend a lot of money to have someone install it. Simple, convenient and intelligent. 【Self Clean, Blue Light & 24H Timer】- Long time use will leave some dirt inside the ice maker, and it is quite difficult to clean. So we designed an self cleaning function for it. In addition to this, the ice machine also has 24-hour startup / shutdown timer and a blue light to make ice looks clear. So many functions are integrated into such a compact body (16.53×14.96×29.72 L×W×H). LifePlus commercial ice machine will never let you down.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71wgkENtgAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LifePlus","source_asin":"B095WJQ862","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-106677","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B095WJQ862","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B095WJQ862","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
