window.products.push({"id":106713,"name":"Replacement for 240534701(Middle) 240534901 Refrigerator Door Shelf Compatible with Frigidaire Kenmore Refrigerator Rack Bar Replacement for AP3214631","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":36.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61QlggR38ZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Fitment: These refrigerator rack bars are widely compatible with Frigidaire, Kenmore, Universal/Multiflex (Frigidaire), Gibson, Galaxy, Crosley, White-Westinghouse, Kelvinator. If your model compatible with WRT18, WRT1G, WRT21, WRT8, WWTR18, 25331, 25361, 25360, 25362, 35363, 25364, 25370, FFHI18, FFHI21, FFHT18, FRT18, FFHT20, FFHT21, NFTR18, FFTR18, CFHT18, CRT18, CRTE18, KATR18, GRT21... These rack will compatible with your fridge. Please confirm your fridge’s model before purchasing. Feature: Made of high quality plastic. total 3 pcs. This material has good flexibility, wear-resistant and durable, not easily deformed and easy to clean in daily life. 240534901 Replacementt: AP3214630, PS734935, 948954, AH734935, EA734935, EAP734935; 240534701 Replacement: 948952, AP3214631, PS734936, EAP734936. Function: Installed on the inside of your refrigerator door, it will not take up another extra fridge space, you can put your newly bought milk and other bottles on it, and its design can protect the items in all directions, not easily fall from it. Package Include: Only 3 pcs of Refrigerator Door Shelf, as picture shown, no instruction and hardware, Installation method: Easy to install, just Snap-on. Note: These refrigerator rack bars are replacement for part number 240534701 and 240534901. Replacement for part number 240534701 (1 pc) is for the middle rack, but replacement for part number 240534901(2 pcs) is for the top or bottom rack. They can be used in the same fridge. Please don't take them as replacement for part number 240338001/240535101/240535001/280535201. Maybe the picture will make you think they are the same, but in fact the size is not the same.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61QlggR38ZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kojem","source_asin":"B0BC1VCMRK","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-106713","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BC1VCMRK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BC1VCMRK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
