window.products.push({"id":107001,"name":"LIFEPLUS Commercial Ice Maker, 70LBS/24H Under Counter Freestanding Ice Machine w/ 10LBS Ice Bin, 32 Ice Cubes/Cycle, 2 Water Inlet Modes, Self Clean,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":239.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71pJ9quL5iL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Amazing Ice Making Speed for Heavy Use】- Powerful and professional, LifePlus compact commercial ice maker is specially designed for small business and big families that need a lot of ice. It can produce 70LBS of Ice cubes in 24H and 32 pieces of clear ice cubes per 11~20 mins. It will easily meet your daily and business needs. Dicth your inefficient countertop ice maker now! 【Self Clean & ETL / FDA Certification for Commercial Use】- All the materials used are food grade. With ETL and FDA certification, you don't have to worry about the problem about health. And it also has a self-cleaning function. After a long time of use, it only needs to be automatically cleaned regularly. Very easy to maintain. 【Easily Hook Up with Water Line or Water Jugs】- An under counter ice maker with water line connection. A freestanding ice maker with water jug (Normal 5 gallon water bottles are OK). This ice machine can be hooked up in 3~5 simple steps according to different water inlet modes. No need to spend extra money to hire professional installation personnel. Simple and money saving. 【0.22 Cu.Ft. Ice Bin with Overproduce Protection】- Considering that sometimes you don't need ice for the time being. We designed a 0.22 Cu.Ft. ice bin which can help you hold a lot of ice. Although it can not keep the ice frozen, the thermal insulation foam layer can effectively slow down the melting speed of the ice. And overproduce protection will prevent it from making too much ice. 【Adjustable Ice Thickness】- The more intelligent temperature control system gives this ice maker more vitality. You can choose S/M/L ice cubes with different thicknesses according to your personal needs. Whether you want thin chewable ice or thick ice cubes to fill the cooler, this ice maker is your best choice.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71pJ9quL5iL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LifePlus","source_asin":"B0BD5717BX","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-107001","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BD5717BX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BD5717BX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
